        "passed": true,
        "score": 1.0,
        "rationale": "The agent retrieved averages via iot.sensor_stats for Transformer 1 at MAIN, called fmsr.get_failure_modes and fmsr.interpret_dga, and when interpret_dga returned 'LLM unavailable' it correctly fell back to computing the IEC 60599 ratios manually (T2: C2H2/C2H4<0.1, CH4/H2>1, C2H4/C2H6 in 1-4) and the Duval Triangle 1 percentages (30.6/69.4/0.03 -> T3), checked the 10 ppm threshold, compared the methods, justified trust based on absolute gas levels, and mapped to a failure mode from the returned",
        "details": {
